  <metadata>
    <name>Day 4 - West Glacier to Whitefish</name>
    <desc>Monday. Ride back to Whitefish and return the bikes. Track forked from the Bikepacking.com / RideWithGPS Red Meadow Pass Loop (https://ridewithgps.com/routes/15106314). Waypoints (camps, resupply, POIs) added for this trip. Bowman Lake (Night 2) is a ~6 mi signed spur off the North Fork Rd at Polebridge — not on the mainline track.</desc>
    <link href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/15106314"><text>Source route: Red Meadow Pass Loop (RideWithGPS)</text></link>
  </metadata>
  <wpt lat="48.4956" lon="-113.9869">
    <name>Night 3 - West Glacier</name>
    <desc>Night 3 camp, West Glacier area (outside park).</desc>
    <type>Camp</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="48.4111" lon="-114.3376">
    <name>Start / Finish - Whitefish</name>
    <desc>Whitefish, MT. Loop start and finish. Bike pickup at Glacier Cyclery (326 2nd St E).</desc>
    <type>Trailhead</type>
  </wpt>
